Acts 10:1 , Cornelius, a devout man, being commanded by an angel, sends for Peter
Acts 10:11 . who by a vision is taught not to despise the Gentiles;
Acts 10:17 , and is commanded by the Spirit to go with the messenger to Caesarea;
Acts 10:25 , Cornelius shows the occasion of his sending for him;
Acts 10:34 , As he preaches Christ to Cornelius and his company
Acts 10:44 . the Holy Ghost falls on them, and they are baptized.
